    [#brief-item([Raouf Chebri], source-name: [Neon Tech Blog], [Today, we are releasing Neon CLI, a command-line interface that enables developers to manage Neon resources directly from the terminal! With Neon CLI, you can handle authentication, and manage projects, branches, databases, roles, and much more without leaving your command line. Get started by installing the CLI using the following command: Use neonctl auth command \[…\]])],
